### MyCrypto Authentication - Working Version

### Step 1: Login and get tokens
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

###

### Step 2: Copy the access_token from above and paste it below
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI2OGM3OTRjN2NmNjRhOWRmNmFmMjUzOGMiLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3R1c2VyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiZXhwIjoxNzU3OTEyMDg4LCJ0eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIn0.cxz-GqJG_wmJvYufGaEK-_EOtx2wrPqVX_r8mtQgPmU

###

### Step 3: Verify token (use same token as above)
GET http://localhost:8000/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI2OGM3OTRjN2NmNjRhOWRmNmFmMjUzOGMiLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3R1c2VyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiZXhwIjoxNzU3OTEyMDg4LCJ0eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIn0.cxz-GqJG_wmJvYufGaEK-_EOtx2wrPqVX_r8mtQgPmU

###

### Step 4: Register new user (if needed)
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser2@example.com",
  "name": "New User 2",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Step 5: Login with demo user
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@mycrypto.com",
  "password": "demo123"
}

###
